----------
scriptunit-fragment 1
----------

var b = 125

----------
scriptunit-fragment 2
----------

let flag = true

----------
scriptunit-fragment 3
----------

if flag
  set b = 500
end if

----------
scriptunit-fragment 4
----------

let c = b + 1

----------
expect all four units are entered
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | compiles, runs | new | `b` = 500 |
| 2 | - | compiles, runs | new | `flag` = true |
| 3 | reads `flag` (2), updates `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | compiles, runs | new | `c` = 501 |

----------
scriptunit-edit 2
----------

let flag = false

----------
expect unit 2 is edited so the write does not happen
----------

| unit | uses | this step | because | holds after |
|------|------|-----------|---------|-------------|
| 1 | - | reruns | rerun: unit 3 may not write `b`, so it needs `b` as unit 1 made it | `b` = 125 |
| 2 | - | recompiles, runs | edited | `flag` = false |
| 3 | reads `flag` (2), updates `b` (1) | reruns | reads `flag` from unit 2 | - |
| 4 | reads `b` (1) | reruns | reads `b` after unit 3, which no longer writes it | `c` = 126 |

